sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant S as Web Shop
    participant P as Payment Service
    participant B as Bank
    C->>S: Place order
    S->>P: Create payment request
    P->>B: Authorize card
    B-->>P: Authorization result
    alt Payment approved
        P-->>S: Payment confirmed
        S-->>C: Show receipt
    else Payment declined
        P-->>S: Payment failed
        S-->>C: Ask for another card
    end